WEBVTT

00:00:00.320 --> 00:00:02.659
Every air app gives you a number.

00:00:02.659 --> 00:00:11.024
But a number doesn't know your father has asthma, your kitchen runs on gas, or your daughter walks to school at eight.

00:00:11.724 --> 00:00:12.787
AirMitra does.

00:00:12.787 --> 00:00:19.316
A household air coach for India — all twenty-eight states and eight union territories.

00:00:19.316 --> 00:00:26.984
Bhopal's headline is the median of its official stations, with the range, distance and age beside it.

00:00:26.984 --> 00:00:28.958
Weather in the same block.

00:00:28.958 --> 00:00:31.236
Every number shows its source.

00:00:31.936 --> 00:00:34.861
Your home is not always where you are.

00:00:34.861 --> 00:00:37.710
Set home once; change it in Settings.

00:00:37.710 --> 00:00:42.021
Switch the current location from the header, or tap GPS.

00:00:42.021 --> 00:00:47.872
The badge tells you which one you're reading, and home is never overwritten.

00:00:48.572 --> 00:00:50.762
Choose your language first.

00:00:50.762 --> 00:00:56.684
Thirteen Indian languages — the interface, brief and every answer follow.

00:00:57.384 --> 00:01:04.323
Then the household: you, a father with asthma, a child, an elder, a pregnancy.

00:01:04.323 --> 00:01:08.861
Cooking fuel, windows, purifier, sweeping, commute.

00:01:08.861 --> 00:01:12.864
Advice for each person, not the city average.

00:01:13.564 --> 00:01:20.442
Gemini turns it into a brief: one directive, the reason, and an 'if you must go out' line.

00:01:20.442 --> 00:01:27.243
It refreshes hourly, and the do-now advice changes morning, afternoon, evening and night.

00:01:27.243 --> 00:01:30.988
Rules return the same shape if the model is busy.

00:01:31.688 --> 00:01:32.692
Or just ask.

00:01:32.692 --> 00:01:40.728
'Is it safe for my father to walk now?' The answer uses the live air, his asthma and my routine.

00:01:40.728 --> 00:01:45.416
Gemini writes the language; it never invents the number.

00:01:46.116 --> 00:01:54.722
One tap builds a high-quality story card: best hours, three actions, the impact, and one way to give back.

00:01:54.722 --> 00:01:59.268
Share it to WhatsApp, X, Telegram, Facebook or LinkedIn.

00:01:59.968 --> 00:02:02.843
Every city has a public page — no login.

00:02:02.843 --> 00:02:05.862
Bhopal shows its median and station range.

00:02:05.862 --> 00:02:14.632
Search covers one thousand two hundred and thirty-eight cities across all twenty-eight states and eight union territories.

00:02:15.332 --> 00:02:16.501
No accounts.

00:02:16.501 --> 00:02:17.767
No analytics.

00:02:17.767 --> 00:02:20.982
The profile stays on your device.

00:02:20.982 --> 00:02:21.664
No ads.

00:02:21.664 --> 00:02:22.930
No data sold.

00:02:22.930 --> 00:02:28.970
CAMS is a model, not a measurement, and it is always labelled.

00:02:28.970 --> 00:02:34.620
AirMitra — because clean air advice should know your home.

00:02:34.620 --> 00:02:38.516
Live at airmitra-app dot vercel dot app.
